{title: No Longer Slaves}
{artist: I Am They}
{key: B}
{capo: 4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[B]You unravel me, with a melody
[E]You surround me [F#]with a [B]song
[B]Of deliverance, from my enemies
[E]Till all my [F#]fears are [B]gone
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[E]I’m no longer a [F#]slave to [B]fear
[G#m]I am a [F#]child of [B]God
[E]I’m no longer a [F#]slave to [B]fear
[G#m]I am a [F#]child of [B]God
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Break}
[G#m] [F#] [B] [E] [G#m] [F#] [B] [E]

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[B]From my Mother’s womb
[D#m]You have chosen me
[E]Love has [F#]called my [B]name
[B]I’ve been born again, into your [D#5]family
[E]Your blood flows [F#]through my [B]veins
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[E]I’m no longer a [F#]slave to [B]fear
[G#m]I am a [F#]child of [B]God
[E]I’m no longer a [F#]slave to [B]fear
[G#m]I am a [F#]child of [B]God
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
[G#m]Ohhh, [F#]Ohhh... [B] [E]
[G#m]Ohhh, [F#]Ohhh... [B] [E]
[G#m]Ohhh, [F#]Ohhh... [B] [E]
[G#m]Ohhh, [F#]Ohhh... [B] [E]

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[G#m]You split the sea so [F#]I could walk right [B]through it [E]
[G#m]My fears are drowned in [F#]perfect love [B] [E]
[G#m]You rescued me so [F#]I could stand and [B]sing [G#m]
[E]I am a [F#]child of [B]God
[G#m]You split the sea so [F#]I could walk right [B]through it [E]
[G#m]My fears are drowned in [F#]perfect love [B] [E]
[G#m]You rescued me so [F#]I could stand and [B]sing [G#m]
[E]I am a [F#]child of [B]God
{end_of_bridge}

